B.bs9={billing:0,qsrBilling:1,menuManagement:2,thermalPrinting:3,storeConfiguration:4,dayEndReports:5,staffManagement:6,backupRestore:7,dineInBilling:8,tableManagement:9,reservations:10,dualPrinting:11,expenseManagement:12,analytics:13,cloudSync:14,emailReceipts:15,kdsEnabled:16,waiterOrdering:17,onlineMenu:18,qrOrdering:19,onlineOrderingEnabled:20,multiOutlet:21,inventoryEnabled:22,barcodeBilling:23,customerKhata:24,stockManagement:25}
B.bbo=s(["Counter till","Order history"],t.s)
B.b7t=s(["Settle","Discount","Void (manager PIN)","Order notes"],t.s)
B.acB=new A.hd(B.bbo,B.b7t,"The till itself. Add dishes to an order, change quantities, apply a line or bill discount, add a note, let the app work out tax and service charge, then settle in cash, on the restaurant's own card machine, or against its UPI ID by QR. Voids and discounts above the limit ask for a manager PIN.","Never off. Billing survives an expired licence, no network and a migration in progress \u2014 it is the one thing a till must always do.",!0)
B.bm_=s(["Home card: Counter Billing","Counter till"],t.s)
B.b6M=s(["Category dish grid","Dish search","Token number"],t.s)
B.acD=new A.hd(B.bm_,B.b6M,"The counter screen: a tappable dish grid by category, search, and a token number on every order (#101, #102\u2026) that resets at midnight. This is what a takeaway counter or a quick-service window runs on.","The Counter Billing card disappears from the home screen. Orders still exist; there is no fast counter screen to raise them from.",!0)
B.blf=s(["Home card: Menu Config","Menu configuration"],t.s)
B.aFq=s(["Add / edit dish","Manage categories","Dish availability (86)"],t.s)
B.ach=new A.hd(B.blf,B.aFq,"Create and edit dishes: name, category and sub-category, price, veg/non-veg, availability window, and whether the dish goes to the kitchen or straight over the counter. Mark a dish sold out and it is unavailable on every terminal at once.","The Menu Config card disappears. Dishes already on the device still bill; nobody can add or change one.",!0)
B.b5B=s(["Printer settings"],t.s)
B.b58=s(["Print Bill (table sheet)","Print (order history)","Auto-print on settlement"],t.s)
B.acn=new A.hd(B.b5B,B.b58,"Bluetooth thermal printers at 58 mm and 80 mm: connect, set the receipt layout \u2014 store name, address, GSTIN, invoice prefix, header and footer text, which totals to show \u2014 and print the customer bill, automatically on settlement if the owner wants.","No printer settings, no Print buttons in the table sheet or order history. Bills are still raised and can be shared as text or PDF.",!0)
B.b4O=s(["Home card: Store Settings","Store configuration"],t.s)
B.b4I=s(["Profile & legal","Taxes & charges","Payments & UPI","Hours & shifts"],t.s)
B.acv=new A.hd(B.b4O,B.b4I,"Everything about the store itself: name, phone, address, GSTIN and FSSAI, tax and service-charge rates, packaging and delivery charges, the UPI ID guests pay into, opening hours and meal shifts.","The Store Settings card disappears. Whatever was configured stays in force.",!0)
B.b6y=s(["Z-report / day-end (till app bar)"],t.s)
B.act=new A.hd(B.ab,B.b6y,"Close the day: the Z-report totals the shift by payment mode, compares counted cash against what the system expects, and hands the register over.","The Z-report button in the till is absent.",!0)
B.b5i=s(["Home card: Staff Mapping","Staff management"],t.s)
B.blu=s(["Add / edit staff","Role","PIN"],t.s)
B.aci=new A.hd(B.b5i,B.blu,"Add staff with a username, password and 4-digit PIN, and give each a role \u2014 owner, manager, billing, kitchen, waiter \u2014 that decides which screens they can reach.","The Staff Mapping card disappears. Existing logins keep working.",!0)
B.b8L=s(["Settings: Backup & Restore","Printer settings: Layout backup"],t.s)
B.acj=new A.hd(B.ab,B.b8L,"Export everything this device holds \u2014 bills, menu, customers, settings \u2014 into one file encrypted with a passphrase the owner chooses, and restore it onto a new device. Staff logins are not included; they come back with the owner's sign-in.","The backup section in Settings and the printer-layout backup card are absent.",!0)
B.aSz=s(["Till: Pending Bills tab","Till: pay-later choice","Table sheet: Collect Payment","Order history: Collect Payment"],t.s)
B.acz=new A.hd(B.ab,B.aSz,"Pay-later dining. An order can stay open while the guests eat, take more rounds, and be settled at the end. The till gets a Pending Bills tab listing every running tab.","Every order is paid when it is raised. The till has one tab, the Dine-in choice goes straight to payment, and Collect Payment is absent from the table sheet and order history.",!0)
B.b7m=s(["Home card: Tables & Floor","Table management"],t.s)
B.bmY=s(["Table picker (till)","Seat / clean / block","Move table","Merge tables"],t.s)
B.acu=new A.hd(B.b7m,B.bmY,"The floor. A card per table showing vacant, seated, occupied, billed, reserved, cleaning or blocked, with seat, clean, block, move and merge actions, and a table picker in the till so a bill carries its table number onto the KOT and the printed bill.",'The Tables & Floor card disappears and the till stops asking which table \u2014 a dine-in order is recorded as "Dine-in" and still bills normally.',!0)
B.b6G=s(["Table sheet: Reserve Table","Table sheet: Change time / re-reserve","Table sheet: Cancel reservation"],t.s)
B.aco=new A.hd(B.ab,B.b6G,"Take a booking over the phone against a specific table: guest name, phone, party size and time. The table shows as reserved on the floor so it is not sold twice, and the booking can be edited, seated or cancelled.","The reserve actions are absent from the table sheet; tables work otherwise.",!0)
B.ayv=s(["Store settings: auto-print KOT","KDS: Print Kitchen KOT Slip"],t.s)
B.acw=new A.hd(B.ab,B.ayv,"A second slip for the kitchen. When an order is fired, a kitchen ticket prints with the table, token and the items that need cooking; counter-only items are left off it.","Only the customer bill prints. The KOT toggle and the KDS slip button are absent.",!0)
B.b4l=s(["Home card: Expenses","Expenses"],t.s)
B.bmZ=s(["Store settings: Expense Categories tab"],t.s)
B.acq=new A.hd(B.b4l,B.bmZ,"What went out of the drawer: vegetables, gas, wages, repairs \u2014 with a category, an amount and a note, so the day's closing cash is the truth and not a guess.","The Expenses card and the Expense Categories tab in Store Settings are absent.",!0)
B.b6h=s(["Home card: Analytics & Rush","Analytics"],t.s)
B.be3=s(["KDS: kitchen analytics"],t.s)
B.acA=new A.hd(B.b6h,B.be3,"Sales read back to the owner: revenue by day and by hour, the rush pattern across the week, top dishes, category splits and average bill value, computed from the store's own order records.","The Analytics card disappears, along with the kitchen analytics view on the KDS.",!0)
B.bcH=s(["Order history: Refresh","Menu: Sync to cloud / Pull from Sheets","Settings: new-KOT sound","Staff: Google sheet access","Table & menu sync to the store sheet"],t.s)
B.acy=new A.hd(B.ab,B.bcH,"The shared ledger. Bills, tables and order status go to the cloud store and come back to every other device, with anything raised offline queued and sent when the connection returns. This is what makes a second device possible at all.","The store is a single till with its own records. Nothing leaves the device: no sync, no Refresh, no Google grants, no new-order chime, and the queue simply holds anything that would have been sent.",!0)
B.baA=s(["Till: customer e-mail field","Waiter: customer e-mail field"],t.s)
B.acE=new A.hd(B.ab,B.baA,"Ask the guest for an e-mail at checkout and send them the bill.","The e-mail field is absent from the payment sheets; nothing else changes.",!0)
B.aTn=s(["Home card: Kitchen (KDS)","Kitchen display"],t.s)
B.b97=s(["Menu: Kitchen Stations","Menu: dish station","Staff: assigned station"],t.s)
B.acG=new A.hd(B.aTn,B.b97,"A screen in the kitchen instead of paper. Tickets arrive live and move through new \u2192 cooking \u2192 ready, with a timer on each, a chime on arrival, and a station filter so the tandoor sees tandoor items. Dishes carry a station, and staff can be assigned to one.","The Kitchen (KDS) card disappears, and the station fields vanish from the dish editor and the staff editor because nothing reads them.",!0)
B.b7x=s(["Home card: Waiter Pad","Waiter pad (table picker)","Waiter order taking"],t.s)
B.bdu=s(["Table card: Take Order","Table sheet: Place order for customers"],t.s)
B.acm=new A.hd(B.b7x,B.bdu,"A phone or tablet on the floor. The captain picks a table, takes the order there, and fires it to the kitchen without walking to the counter. Rounds can be added to a running tab.","The Waiter Pad card disappears. On the floor screen, a table card seats the guest and nothing more \u2014 dishes are added from the till.",!0)
B.b46=s(["Menu: publish to the public store","Branches: Copy menu link","Branches: Open menu"],t.s)
B.acp=new A.hd(B.ab,B.b46,"A public web menu for the store, published from the POS menu: categories, dishes, veg marks and prices, kept current every time the menu is saved.","Nothing is published. The menu-link buttons are absent, and the menu screen stops writing the public store record.",!0)
B.be6=s(["Table card: QR","Table sheet: Table QR standee","Branches: Print table QR standees"],t.s)
B.ack=new A.hd(B.ab,B.be6,"A QR standee per table. The guest scans it, sees the menu, and places an order that lands on the counter and the kitchen marked as coming from that table.","The QR buttons on table cards, in the table sheet and on the branch cards are absent.",!0)
B.aVc=s(["Public store record: onlineOrderingEnabled"],t.s)
B.acC=new A.hd(B.ab,B.aVc,"Lets the public menu take takeaway orders, not just show the menu \u2014 the link can be shared anywhere. Switching it off leaves the menu readable and tells guests the store is not taking orders online.","The guest page shows the menu but no cart. (The guest web app is a separate deployment; it reads this flag from the public store record.)",!0)
B.b4L=s(["Home card: Outlets / Stores","Branch management"],t.s)
B.amw=s(["Analytics: store scope","Order history: outlet filter"],t.s)
B.acx=new A.hd(B.b4L,B.amw,"More than one branch under one owner: create outlets, switch between them, and scope reports to one store, several, or all of them.","The Outlets card disappears, analytics has no store scope, and order history stops looking for sibling outlets.",!0)
B.acF=new A.hd(B.ab,B.ab,"NOT BUILT. The key exists and can be switched on, but no screen, field or button in the app reads it \u2014 turning it on changes nothing a restaurant would notice. Stock tracking, ingredient recipes and supplier orders are all unwritten. Do not include it in a package or promise it to a client until it has code behind it.","Identical to on, which is the problem.",!1)
B.b5J=s(["Barcode Billing"],t.s)
B.b61=s(["Home card: Barcode Billing"],t.s)
B.acr=new A.hd(B.b5J,B.b61,"Barcode-first checkout designed for retail, grocery, supermarket, and pharmacy. Point hardware barcode scanner or type SKU to instantly add items to cart, compute taxes, tender cash with change calculator, and print receipts.","The Barcode Billing card is hidden from the dashboard.",!0)
